        "@value": "Fire Rescue Open House &#038; Pancake Breakfast"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;October 5-11 is Fire Safety Week. Join Pender Islands Fire Rescue at Fire Hall #1 on October 11 from 10AM to 2PM for our annual open house and world-famous pancake breakfast. You can bring your fire extinguisher in for its yearly visual inspection and let us address any fire safety questions you have. Free.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
