    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pender Island Chamber of Commerce WINTER SOCIAL"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us for our WINTER SOCIAL on Thursday, December 4. This is a fun, festive get together with other island business and community leaders to celebrate our collective achievements this past year. There’ll be live music, finger foods, a cash bar, prizes and a few fun surprises. \r\n\r\nHost: Pender Island Chamber of Commerce\r\nDate: Thursday, December 4, 2025\r\nTime: 5PM onwards\r\nVenue: Franklin Castle\r\nTicket Price Members and Guests: $25\r\n\r\nRSVPs open to November 29, 2025. There is a cap on the numbers at this venue, so please be sure to book your space early! To reserve your spot, please RSVP and send your payment by e-transfer to info@penderislandchamber.com. Your advance payment helps us confirm catering numbers and keep the evening running smoothly. Thank you!\r\n\r\nCancellation Policy: Please note that tickets are non-refundable after November 29, 2025."
      }
    ],
