        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Winter&#8217;s Wake"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Winter's Wake: A Celebration of the Seasonal Ghost Story\r\nA fireside celebration of the classic Christmas ghost story tradition with chilling tales, themed drinks, and seasonal surprises.\r\nTickets available at winterswake.ca or at Talisman Books.\r\nDoors will open at 3:15, the show starts at 4. Full bar and menu will be available.\r\n"
      }
