        "@value": "Food &#038; Funds Drive"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "On Thanksgiving weekend, the Pender Islands Food Bank is hosting its second annual Food and Funds Drive. Join us on Saturday, October 11 from 10AM to 2PM at the Driftwood Centre for some great music by the Scanlan Brothers with a donation of food or funds. "
      }
