        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Celebrate The 6th Annual Crisp festival runs October 2-3, 2026 at Pender Island Community Hall. This vibrant fall festival features music, art, storytelling, workshops, and apple-themed fun, all focused on sustainability and community connection. &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
